        <pb n="4" facs="#f04" />
        <div n="4" type="scan" subtype="medical-philological-treatises">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f04-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">㽲痛切痛同</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f04-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">㽲痛字昉見金匱當歸生姜羊肉湯及當歸</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f04-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">芍藥散條切痛字見附子粳米湯條㽲字説</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f04-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">文不載按㽲者㽱之俗體説文云㽱腹中急</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f04-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">痛也集韻音絞千金外臺倶引㽲作絞此則</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f04-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">㽲痛卽絞痛絞之義為急故論語直而無禮</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f04-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">則絞鄭玄云絞急也切亦訓急氣交變大論</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f04-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">其政勁切王注切急也左傳昭公元年叔孫</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f04-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">絞而婉杜注絞切也廣韻切迫也毛晃增注</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal" corresp="#f04-l-c09">
              <label>右側長方朱印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">富士川游寄贈</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal" corresp="#f04-l-c09">
              <label>欄外長方朱印與右側寄贈印相對之大印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">□</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal">
              <label>欄外左上橢圓黑印</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="black">186177　大正7.3.31</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：空白襯頁，未見當面文字。 左面：內題無「説」字，與函題分記。訓讀符未見密列。㽲、㽱字形另候㽲／㽱，仍依所示病字頭內形區分。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:9">
              <quote>欄外五視印</quote>
              <note type="editorial">此處墨跡或構件不清，以□保留未定字。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="5" facs="#f05" />
        <div n="5" type="scan" subtype="medical-philological-treatises">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f05-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">禮部韻畧切迫也急也據此曰切痛曰絞痛</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f05-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">倶是腹中緊急切迫而痛之状是以千金外</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f05-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">臺婦人門中所載曰切曰絞互相出入而無</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f05-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">甚徑庭亦可以證矣而讀者不察以切痛為</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f05-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">如刀切之義陋已蓋以切與絞彊而分之則</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f05-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">稱絞痛之尤劇者謂之切則或有之斷非裁</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f05-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">切之義但從來注家一言未有及此者爰録</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f05-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">淺見所及以俟識者</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f05-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">辛亥五月二日　丹波元佶稿</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f05-r-c09">
              <label>版心葉次</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">二</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f05-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">陰陽易病辨誤</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f05-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">陰陽易者總揭男女之稱也陰易陽易者辨</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f05-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">別男女之稱也病源云傷寒陰陽易病者是</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f05-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">男子婦人傷寒病新差未平復而與之交接</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f05-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">得病者名為陰陽易也其男子病新差未平</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f05-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">復而婦人與之交接得病者名陰易二證之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f05-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">別判然可見矣甞閱明趙開美校刻宋板傷</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f05-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">寒論陰陽易之為病條陰字下分注陽易二</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f05-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">字而其證則重在男子陰易矣余每疑之攷</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f05-l-c09">
              <label>版心葉次</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">一</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：右葉為主篇末，末欄上書紀日、下書署稿。上部字形畧／略、状／狀依所見。 左面：左面另起附篇，版心葉次重置。本文為古籍病名與版本辨析，保留原分欄。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="6" facs="#f06" />
        <div n="6" type="scan" subtype="medical-philological-treatises">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f06-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">千金方及翼方引此條作陰易之病醫心方</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f06-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">引葛氏方亦稱陰易病宋無求子及南陽活</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f06-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">人書陳無擇三因方引經文並作陰</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f06-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">易之為病朱肱無擇輩皆治平以後之人去</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f06-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">林億等挍正之時猶未數十年則宋臣挍正</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f06-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">舊本無陽字從可見已逮金成無已據玉函</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f06-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">經作陰陽易之為病明萬曆中趙開美刻仲</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f06-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">景全書後挍刻宋板亦從成氏本始補以陽</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f06-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">字以其無空位故細書補填之而已後人因</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f06-r-c09">
              <label>右面第3欄「人書」下雙行小註</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">醫方類／聚引</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="running-title" corresp="#f06-r-c09">
              <label>版心葉次</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">二</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f06-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">循莫之能悟長沙舊文遂屬隱晦可嘆也已</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f06-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">爰為之辨如右</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f06-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">己酉夏六月　棠邊丹波元佶撰</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：第3欄的小字註與大字分錄。兩個「挍正」與「挍刻」保留所見扌旁，待核。 左面：此面為附篇末。紀年與署撰同在一欄。位次為舊文刊刻論辨，與主篇辛亥署期分列。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:5">
              <quote>挍正</quote>
              <note type="editorial">第3欄的小字註與大字分錄。兩個「挍正」與「挍刻」保留所見扌旁，待核。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:8">
              <quote>挍刻</quote>
              <note type="editorial">第3欄的小字註與大字分錄。兩個「挍正」與「挍刻」保留所見扌旁，待核。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:6">
              <quote>無已</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">無已</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">無己</seg>
              <note type="editorial">原圖留讀及異讀候選。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="7" facs="#f07" />
        <div n="7" type="scan" subtype="vermilion-inscription">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text">
              <label>框內朱筆第1欄</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">此書先生新著之一辛酉□月先生侍于</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text">
              <label>框內朱筆第2欄</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">皇駕自洛還謝余勞賜此卷追請□小</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text">
              <label>框內朱筆第3欄</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">不二枝布之三物□□□而可以永矣</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text">
              <label>框內朱筆第4欄</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">先生告云</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="seal">
              <label>框內朱印兩枚</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="red">□□</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：後加朱筆另層。第1欄月前字形候穀，第三欄中段暫留未定。第4欄可辨末端不排除省筆。 左面：主要是朱筆反向透字。下緣有少量墨筆，字形及是否為館記未定。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:None">
              <quote>框內朱筆第3欄</quote>
              <note type="editorial">此處墨跡或構件不清，以□保留未定字。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:None">
              <quote>框內朱印兩枚</quote>
              <note type="editorial">此處墨跡或構件不清，以□保留未定字。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:None">
              <quote />
              <note type="editorial">後加朱筆另層。第1欄月前字形候穀，第三欄中段暫留未定。第4欄可辨末端不排除省筆。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:None">
              <quote />
              <note type="editorial">主要是朱筆反向透字。下緣有少量墨筆，字形及是否為館記未定。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="8" facs="#f08" />
